<title>USA: IPO FILING - OSI Systems Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - OSI Systems Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		    OSI Systems Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			OSIS.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   N/A</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.7 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3.33 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  370,000</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    9,458,874</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  555,000 shrs Business: Based in Hawthorne, Calif., OSI is a vertically integrated worldwide provider of devices, subsystems and end-products based on optoelectronic technology.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To repay certain debt, to increase funds available for research and development, to enhance its sales and marketing capabilities, to pursue possible acquistions, and for general corporate purposes, including working capital.</p>
